This is a test of MemoryUtilities::printMemoryInfo and
MemoryUtilities::printMaxMemory.  Each processor allocates a buffer and
the test checks that processor 0 reports, for every processor, a
maximum memory at least as large as that buffer.

The files included in this directory are as follows:

   main.cpp       -  code for the test

COMPILATION AND EXECUTION
-------------------------
   Compilation:
      make memory_utilities

   Execution:
      make test

INPUT PARAMETERS
----------------
An optional first argument gives the buffer size in MiB (default 64).
A value above 2048 checks that memory beyond the range of int is
reported correctly.
